An explanation of the audio tapes. These are tapes of working the OMI (Orbiter Maintenance Instructions) procedure. Some of these procedures:<BR>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- OMI S0007 - Integrated OMI for load and launch of the space shuttle. This consisted of 5 volumes (see below Launch OMI - S0007VL1.TXT thru Launch OMI - S0007VL5.TXT<BR>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- OMI S0017 - Integrated OMI for the TCDT - Terminal CountDown Test. A simulation of launch countdown for the crew of the space shuttle to experience what would happen on launch day and familiarize themselves with the Shuttle they would fly in.<BR>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- OMI V1009.04 - MPS LO2 leak checks, checking the Main Propulsion System for any leaks using a helium leak detector. For a description of the MPS system see <A HREF="Shuttle/SSME_MPS_Info/Lessons Learned from the Design Certification Operation of the Space Shuttle Integrated Main Propulsion System 20110013223.pdf" target="_blank">Lessons Learned from the Design Certification Operation of the Space Shuttle Integrated Main Propulsion System 20110013223</A><BR>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- OMI V1011.06 - SSME Leak checks and Flight Readiness Test (Gimbal checks and flow checks). For a full description of SSME procesing see <A HREF="Shuttle/SSME_MPS_Info/NASA TP - 1998 - 208530 Reusable Rocket Engine Operability Modeling and Analysis Christenson_and_Komar.pdf" target="_blank">NASA TP - 1998 - 208530 Reusable Rocket Engine Operability Modeling and Analysis Christenson_and_Komar</A><BR>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- OMI V1202 - Integrated MPS /SSME leak check, checking the Main Propulsion System and the Space Shuttle Maine Engines as a single unit for any leaks using a helium leak detector. For a description of the Helium Signature test see <A HREF="Shuttle/SSME_MPS_Info/V1202_1030718main_AIAA_HeSigTest.pdf" target="_blank">V1202_1030718main_AIAA_HeSigTest</A> and <A HREF="Shuttle/SSME_MPS_Info/V1202_1030721main_Evolution of the Main Propulsion Helium Signature Test .pdf" target="_blank">V1202_1030721main_Evolution of the Main Propulsion Helium Signature Test</A><BR>
The Audio tapes are in the <A HREF="Shuttle/STS_Launch_Processing_Voice_Tapes/">STS Voice Tapes directory</a>:
